### Generate presigned-url
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/media/generate-presigned-url
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filename":"pikachu.png",
  "mimeType":"image/png",
  "usage":"POST"
}

### Upload to s3
PUT presigned-url
Content-Type: image/png

< ./pikachu.png

### Create media
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/media/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "object-url",
	"mimeType": "image/png",
	"size": 78,
	"type":"IMAGE"
}

### Get all users - ADMIN
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/

### Get me
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me

### Update me
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "rambo",
    "socialLinks": [{
      "platform": "linkedin",
      "link": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/ayush-shende-708685413/"
    },{
      "platform": "github",
      "link": "https://github.com/AyushShende25"
    }],
    "avatar": "https://profile-url.com",
    "bio": "most amazing bio ever written"
}

### Delete me
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me

